{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2023-06-29 11:00:00', 'title': 'SOUTHWEST AIRLINES EXTENDS FLIGHT SCHEDULE THROUGH MARCH 6, 2024, AND ADDS NEW SEASONAL SERVICE', 'text': 'DALLAS , JUNE 29, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. (NYSE: LUV) EXTENDED ITS FLIGHT SCHEDULE TODAY THROUGH MARCH 6, 2024, ENABLING CUSTOMERS TO BOOK THEIR EARLY 2024 GETAWAYS. SOUTHWEST® ALSO ANNOUNCED TODAY IT IS ADDING NEW SEASONAL NONSTOP SERVICE.'}